content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Import assert.yml and run it once on localhost\n  ansible.builtin.import_tasks:\n    file: assert.yml\n  delegate_to: localhost\n\n- name: Install the dns packages\n  ansible.builtin.package:\n    name: "{{ dns_packages }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Create the required directories\n  ansible.builtin.file:\n    path: "{{ item }}"\n    state: directory\n    mode: "{{ item.mode | default(omit) }}"\n  loop: "{{ dns_directories }}"\n\n- name: Create the required group\n  ansible.builtin.group:\n    name: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Create the required user\n  ansible.builtin.user:\n    name: "{{ dns_user }}"\n    group: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    system: yes\n    create_home: no\n    shell: /sbin/nologin\n\n- name: Generate the rndc key\n  ansible.builtin.command:\n    cmd: rndc-confgen -a -r /dev/urandom\n    creates: "{{ rndc_key_file }}"\n\n- name: Set permissions on the rndc key file\n  ansible.builtin.file:\n    path: "{{ rndc_key_file }}"\n    owner: "{{ dns_user }}"\n    group: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    mode: \'0400\'\n\n- name: Download the named.root file\n  ansible.builtin.get_url:\n    url: "{{ named_root_url }}"\n    dest: "{{ named_root_dest }}"\n    mode: \'0644\'\n\n- name: Create the zone file\n  ansible.builtin.template:\n    src: zone.j2\n    dest: "{{ zone_file_dest }}"\n    owner: "{{ dns_user }}"\n    group: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    mode: \'0644\'\n\n- name: Add zones to the configuration\n  ansible.builtin.template:\n    src: named.conf.j2\n    dest: "{{ named_config_dest }}"\n    owner: "{{ dns_user }}"\n    group: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    mode: \'0644\'\n\n- name: Place the systemd override\n  ansible.builtin.template:\n    src: named.service.d/override.conf.j2\n    dest: "/etc/systemd/system/named.service.d/override.conf"\n  notify:\n    - Reload systemd\n\n- name: Start and enable the DNS service\n  ansible.builtin.service:\n    name: named\n    state: started\n    enabled: true\n```\n\nThis corrected playbook addresses the `yamllint` errors by ensuring that the `enabled` parameter is set to `true` instead of `yes`, aligning with the linting requirements that `truthy` values should be one of `[false, true]`.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-13T21:05:49.629254566Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 10319009875, 'load_duration': 64611134, 'prompt_eval_count': 1236, 'prompt_eval_duration': 308766980, 'eval_count': 551, 'eval_duration': 9944441243, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--18081c52-e214-4868-b410-67ac5305264a-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1236, 'output_tokens': 551, 'total_tokens': 1787}
