content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Lookup bootstrap facts by running the `cat /etc/os-release` command\n  ansible.builtin.command:\n    cmd: cat /etc/os-release\n  register: bootstrap_facts\n  changed_when: false\n\n- name: Set bootstrap distribution and major version facts\n  ansible.builtin.set_fact:\n    bootstrap_distribution: "{{ item.key }}"\n    bootstrap_major_version: >-\n      {{ bootstrap_facts.stdout_lines\n      | selectattr(\'key\', \'in\', [\'NAME\', \'VERSION_ID\'])\n      | map(attribute=\'value\')\n      | list\n      | join(\' \')\n      | regex_replace(\'^(.+? )?([0-9]+).*$\', \'\\\\2\') }}\n  with_dict: "{{ bootstrap__os_family_map }}"\n  when: bootstrap_facts.stdout is search(item.value)\n\n- name: Set bootstrap OS family fact\n  ansible.builtin.set_fact:\n    bootstrap_os_family: "{{ item.key }}"\n  with_dict: "{{ bootstrap__os_family_map }}"\n  when: bootstrap_facts.stdout is search(item.value)\n```\n\n### Explanation:\n1. **Changed `changed_when` to `false`:** For the first task, the `changed_when` directive was added to address the `no-changed-when` linting error, ensuring that the task doesn\'t mark the host as changed when nothing needs to be done.\n\n2. **Updated `set_fact` to `ansible.builtin.set_fact`:** The FQCN (Fully Qualified Collection Name) was added to the `set_fact` tasks to fix the `fqcn` linting errors.\n\n3. **Replaced Jinja2 in `when` with `search`:** The `when` conditions in the latter two tasks were modified to use `search` instead of Jinja2 expressions, addressing the `no-jinja-when` linting errors. This ensures that the conditions are evaluated as Ansible filters and not as Jinja2 expressions.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-13T21:18:03.95797162Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 7552320792, 'load_duration': 49374048, 'prompt_eval_count': 1956, 'prompt_eval_duration': 881056990, 'eval_count': 400, 'eval_duration': 6621122336, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--792a7b5c-0400-4406-89ed-0a8573da1748-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1956, 'output_tokens': 400, 'total_tokens': 2356}
