content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Configure Apache2 on Debian and Suse systems\n  hosts: all\n  become: true\n  tasks:\n    - name: Enable proxy and proxy_http modules in Apache2\n      community.general.apache2_module:\n        name: "{{ item }}"\n        state: present\n      loop:\n        - proxy\n        - proxy_http\n      when: ansible_os_family in [\'Debian\', \'Suse\']\n\n    - name: Configure Apache2 locations\n      template:\n        src: location.conf.j2\n        dest: "/etc/httpd/conf.d/{{ item.name }}.conf"\n        mode: \'0644\'\n      loop: "{{ httpd_locations }}"\n      notify:\n        - Test Apache2 configuration\n        - Restart Apache2\n\n  handlers:\n    - name: Test Apache2 configuration\n      command: httpd -t\n      changed_when: false\n\n    - name: Restart Apache2\n      service:\n        name: apache2\n        state: restarted\n```\n\nThis corrected playbook adheres to the original task names and order while addressing the linting issues, such as ensuring the playbook starts with `---` and removing any unnecessary content that could lead to parser errors. The `loop` and `when` conditions are correctly applied, and the handlers are properly defined.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-13T21:32:55.200350999Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 4279366067, 'load_duration': 57086972, 'prompt_eval_count': 1444, 'prompt_eval_duration': 6711515, 'eval_count': 268, 'eval_duration': 4214975650, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--dd9132fd-f18f-4d57-91a8-98345e90ba61-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1444, 'output_tokens': 268, 'total_tokens': 1712} 44%|████▍     | 44/100 [34:06<45:28, 48.72s/it]
