content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Create the document root directory for each vhost\n  ansible.builtin.file:\n    path: "{{ item.docroot }}"\n    state: directory\n    mode: "{{ item.mode | default(\'0755\') }}"\n  loop: "{{ httpd_vhosts }}"\n\n- name: Configure the Apache vhost configuration files\n  ansible.builtin.template:\n    src: "{{ vhost_conf_template }}"\n    dest: "/etc/httpd/conf.d/{{ item.name }}.conf"\n  loop: "{{ httpd_vhosts }}"\n\n- name: Enable Apache vhosts on Debian systems\n  ansible.builtin.shell: |\n    a2ensite "{{ item.name }}"\n  args:\n    creates: "/etc/apache2/sites-enabled/{{ item.name }}.conf"\n  loop: "{{ httpd_vhosts }}"\n  when: ansible_facts[\'os_family\'] == \'Debian\'\n```\n\n### Explanation of Changes:\n1. **Task 1**: Added a default file mode of `0755` using the `| default(\'0755\')` filter to address the lint warning about risky file permissions. This ensures a sensible default is used if no mode is specified in `httpd_vhosts`.\n\n2. **Task 3**: Replaced `ansible.builtin.command` with `ansible.builtin.shell` to avoid issues with the `creates` option not being supported with `command`. Using `shell` allows the use of `args` to specify `creates`, ensuring the task only runs if the symbolic link does not already exist.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-13T21:33:15.018459798Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 5136268594, 'load_duration': 58026233, 'prompt_eval_count': 1198, 'prompt_eval_duration': 289541120, 'eval_count': 314, 'eval_duration': 4784457540, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--5668e5d0-8e6e-410e-8a84-2fe90ee42ff4-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1198, 'output_tokens': 314, 'total_tokens': 1512}
